@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC22 Chon va mua goi thuyet minh mo phong

actor "Khach tham quan" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebPublicUI - PackagesPage" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nPublicPackagesController + PublicAccessController + QrService + PublicAccessService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nQrRepository + GuestAccessPassRepository + AccessPaymentSessionRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo trang goi thuyet minh
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau danh sach package
Business -> DataAccess: Doc QR service-level active
DataAccess -> Database: Doc QrLocation khong gan rieng POI/Tour
Database --> DataAccess: Tra danh sach
DataAccess --> Business: Tra QR package
Business --> UI: Tra gia, thoi luong va yeu cau thanh toan
UI --> Actor: Hien thi cac goi

opt Co pass da luu
  UI -> Business: Gui token de validate
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc GuestAccessPass
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc pass va han dung
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra ket qua
  Business --> UI: Tra trang thai pass
end

Actor -> UI: Chon mua goi
UI -> Business: Gui code de bat dau access
Business -> DataAccess: Doc QR va tao pass
DataAccess -> Database: Ghi GuestAccessPass
Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
alt Goi mien phi
  Business --> UI: Tra token ngay
else Goi can thanh toan
  Business -> DataAccess: Tao AccessPaymentSession Pending
  DataAccess -> Database: Ghi payment session
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra session id
  Business --> UI: Tra session
  UI -> Business: Gui thanh toan mo phong thanh cong
  Business -> DataAccess: Kiem tra va cap nhat session/pass
  DataAccess -> Database: Ghi Paid va Active
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra token va han dung
end
alt Nhan duoc token hop le
  UI -> UI: Luu pass cuc bo
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi dem nguoc va nut bat dau nghe
else Bat dau hoac thanh toan loi
  Business --> UI: Tra trang thai loi
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi khong the mua/phat
end
@enduml
